"Uploads experience data to selected robots. \n\n Rank 1: Adds 1 experience level. \n Rank 2: Adds 2 experience levels. \n Rank 3: Adds 3 experience levels. \n\n Note 1: Can be applied to allied robots. \n Note 2: Does not affect Seraph, Widow, Nemesis N2, Cylons, Terminator, cyborgs and manned units."
END

CONTROLBAR:Cybr_ToolTipScienceupload
"*UNUSED* Uploads experience data to selected robots. \n Adds 1 experience level. \n\n Note 1: Can be applied to allied robots. \n Note 2: Does not affect super units, cyborgs and manned units."
END

