GUI:biofeatures_China
"Chinese \n\n Heavy tanks \n Strong infantry \n Hack technologies \n Incendiary weaponry \n Nuclear weaponry \n Neutron weaponry"
END

GUI:biofeatures_GLA
"GLA \n\n Toxic weaponry \n Camouflage and ambushes \n Diversions. \n Larceny."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos0
"Winning Strategy: Constant Air Pressure and Defensive Play
\n
\nGround forces and defenses help you hold off counterattacks.
\n
\nHornets and Lightnings tear through enemy vehicles.
\n
\nFalcons and Chimeras push deep into the enemy base."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos1
"Total Versatility in Strategy
\n
\nA solid lineup of tanks for head-on assaults.
\n
\nMobile, heavy, and precise artillery.
\n
\nMassive overall damage output thanks to acid weapons."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos10
"unimplemented"
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos11
"unimplemented"
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos2
"\nWinning Strategy: Map Control and Wearing Down the Enemy with Relentless Fast-Tank Aggression
\n
\nThe most powerful arsenal of units and upgrades in the game.
\n
\nInsane Superweapon, personally designed by General Tao."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos3
"Winning Strategy: Strong Defense and Economic Growth for Gradual Advancement
\n
\nMobile defenses let you expand quickly and steadily push back the enemy.
\n
\nDevastating upgrades and Superweapons ensure the enemy can't outplay you economically."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos4
"Winning Strategy: Large-Scale Tank Assaults in Unified Groups
\n
\nA unique arsenal of tanks with boosted firepower and armor.
\n
\nAt Rank 3, unlock the devastating Emperor-class heavy tanks."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos5
"Winning Strategy: Head-On Attacks with Durable, High-Power Units
\n
\nLaser Thors excel at map control and support.
\n
\nMicrowave Tanks swiftly disable defenses and structures.
\n
\nA wide variety of combat drones.
\n
\nPowerful upgrades at your disposal."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos6
"Winning Strategy: Ambushes, Sabotage, Attrition, and Chaos
\n
\nThe Command Truck immediately provides a GPS Scrambler.
\n
\nHijackers, saboteurs, powerful artillery, and advanced tech.
\n
\nEasy access to enemy power supply."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos7
"Winning Strategy: Overwhelming Infantry Assaults Backed by APCs
\n
\nNationalism available from the start.
\n
\nECM Soldiers + Rocket Troopers form your core APC squads.
\n
\nCloning Vat allows you to mass-produce infantry quickly and cheaply."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos8
"Winning Strategy: Attrition and Economic Superiority by Destroying Enemy Units at Minimal Cost
\n
\nExtensive use of mines and suicide bombers.
\n
\nBTR-50 Engineer lays minefields across the map.
\n
\nThe Command Truck grants +3% value from every destroyed enemy unit."
END

GUI:biofeatures_pos9
"Uses the best of the best \n All heroes \n All superweapons \n Diverse generals powers \n Units drawn from all factions \n Advanced defenses"
END

GUI:biofeatures_posa
"Winning Strategy: Map Control and Attrition Through Fast Droid Raids
\n
\nRank 1: Fast droids bypass enemy defenses with ease.
\n
\nA wide selection of drones to support each unit.
\n
\nRank 3: Spiders for mobile strikes and Angels for direct clashes."
END

GUI:biofeatures_posb
"Winning Strategy: Unified Group Assaults with a Full Mix of Units and Superior Numbers
\n
\nBattle Masters are cheaper and are built faster.
\n
\nFearsome Dragons unleash deadly firewalls.
\n
\nArtillery and MiGs create raging firestorms.
\n
\nA deadly arsenal of infantry units."
END

GUI:biofeatures_posc
"Winning Strategy: Steady Advancement with Numerical Superiority and Constant Artillery Support
\n
\nDana Howitzers combined with upgraded tunnels give you the upper hand.
\n
\nAt Rank 3, unlock elite vehicles and the Salvage Plant."
END

GUI:biofeatures_usa
"Americans \n\n EMP weaponry \n Laser weaponry \n High precision weapon systems \n Good air forces."
END

GUI:BioFeatures_PosD
"General \"Tigress\" Leoing Leang combines the best of Chinese forces in massive assaults to overwhelm her opponents. \n\n Super Units drawn from all Chinese Generals \n\n Super Weapons: \n - Particle Uplink Cannon \n - Atmospheric Lens \n - Nuclear Missile \n\n The might of China shall fall upon those who oppose it!"
END

GUI:BioFeatures_PosE
