END

GUI:biovictoriousentry_pos8
"You were not prepared for this kind of war. Try again if you dare."
END

GUI:biovictoriousentry_pos9
"Improve your skills and challenge me again."
END

GUI:biovictoriousentry_posa
"You are terminated."
END

GUI:biovictoriousentry_posb
"General, your uniform seems to be on fire..."
END

GUI:biovictoriousentry_posc
"Perhaps your brutal defeat will discourage further attempts. I have better things to do."
END

